"`/usr/local/lib/sbom-web/dist/third-party-licenses.txt`. It comes from the "
"bundled module graph rather than the `package.json` declaration because the "
"two differ: declared dependencies used only at build time (tailwindcss, "
"typescript) never reach the distribution, and a package can be declared and "
"installed yet dropped from the bundle because nothing imports it."
